<title>UK: Royal&amp;Sun names StanChart's Gillam chairman.</title>
<headline>Royal&amp;Sun names StanChart's Gillam chairman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Recently-merged British insurance group Royal &amp; Sun Alliance Group Plc said on Thursday it would appoint Patrick Gillam, chairman of Standard Chartered Plc, as its non-executive chairman from May 9 this year.</p>
<p>The group said in a statement the appointment was in line with plans to hire a chairman from outside the group announced at the time of the merger last May.</p>
<p>Gillam, 63, was a director of British composite giant Commercial Union from 1991 to 1996.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
